## Job

A face `06` note is its own file. The first slot is `06.md` and the stamp says `version: 001`. A later slot is `06.VVV.md`. The lowest free number is the next slot. An earlier `06` file stays. A later writer does not open it.

## Band

This page is a member of the compute band. The band is `0600` through `0699`. The door is `0600`.

## Pair

Law `0056` says a band ends on 9. The director set this compute band through `0699`. Law `0056` was not edited.

